# Cloudflare Pages redirects. The build copies public/ into dist/ verbatim,
# so this file ships at the site root.
#
# The six v1 dashboard URLs are bookmarked by leadership and linked from old
# emails. They keep working, permanently (301), and land on the v2 page that
# absorbed them. Do not remove a line because "nobody uses it any more" -
# a dead bookmark is the first thing a VP notices.
/Leadership_Dashboard.html            /executive       301
/Budget_Performance.html              /executive       301
/YoY_Performance.html                 /executive       301
/Social_Media_Performance.html        /marketing-ops   301
/Marketing_Activity.html              /marketing-ops   301
/Marketing_Pipeline_for_Sales.html    /sales           301

# The root serves the executive page in place (200 rewrite, URL unchanged).
/                                     /executive       200
